  "name": "Item Type",
  "img": "icons/svg/d20-grey.svg",
  "description": "<p><em>Rulebook Table 38 (p.219).</em> Roll a number of times based on loot box rarity (Silver: 1, Gold: 2, Platinum: 3, Legendary: 4, Celestial: 5) to determine the category of each randomized magic item, then roll on the matching sub-table. If you roll \"Something Unique\" on any sub-table, stop rolling further items and resolve Table 42: Something Unique once instead.</p><p>Note: Foundry's default RollTable draw follows a document-linked result into a sub-table automatically (the \"recursive\" draw option), so drawing this table may report both hops (e.g. Item Type, then the sub-table's own result) in a single draw.</p>",
